  "limitations": "Source and construction observations have different dates. M City reconstructions, Absolute interpolation, selected concept models and transit profiles retain their cited uncertainty; no common completion year or current aerial survey is claimed. Inland water levels are terrain-derived display estimates. Transit routes obey scene depth: buildings, bridges and terrain intentionally occlude segments behind them; continuity in route data does not imply that every segment is visible. Construction tree crowns use future-envelope clearances; the landscaping is not a dated construction survey. Supported road and bridge profiles use dated native elevations. Newer QEW and Highway 401 heights are estimated; no as-built survey is claimed.",
